# Alpha OS — GNOME 50 desktop — Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute)
# Provenance: names verified as exact matches against the resolute
# binary-amd64 Packages indexes on archive.ubuntu.com (released 23 Apr 2026).
#
# IMPORTANT LIMITATION: GNOME 50 in resolute is WAYLAND-ONLY. Verified from
# Contents-amd64.gz: gnome-session ships only
#   wayland-sessions/gnome.desktop
# and NO xsessions/gnome.desktop. There is no X11 GNOME session in this
# release. The ONLY X11 option for GNOME is gnome-session-flashback
# (xsessions/gnome-flashback-{compiz,metacity}.desktop), which is included
# below in a comment-delimited stanza.
# There is no `gnome-x11` / `gnome-wayland` package pair any more, and
# `gnome-accessibility` / `breeze-gtk` do not exist in resolute.
# `breeze-gtk` is not needed anyway — Yaru is the GNOME 50 icon/GTK theme.

gnome-shell
mutter
gnome-session-bin
gnome-session
gnome-shell-extensions
gnome-terminal
gnome-control-center
gnome-settings-daemon
gnome-initial-setup
gnome-online-accounts
gnome-calendar
gnome-contacts
gnome-weather
nautilus
nautilus-sendto
gnome-software
gnome-text-editor
simple-scan
shotwell
eog
totem
rhythmbox
yelp
xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
yaru-theme-gtk
yaru-theme-icon
yaru-theme-gnome-shell
orca
gnome-accessibility-themes
gnome-accessibility-profiles
firefox
libreoffice
libreoffice-l10n-en-gb
vlc
fonts-cantarell

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# BEGIN X11-only stanza: GNOME has no native X11 session in resolute.
# gnome-session-flashback provides gnome-flashback-{compiz,metacity}.desktop
# in xsessions/ and is the sole X11 fallback for GNOME. Verified present in
# universe (source gnome-flashback 3.58.0-6ubuntu1).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
gnome-session-flashback
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# END X11-only stanza
